tasks where yt(J) ∼γk(θi,k,t) is generated from latent
skill for controlled scaling (used in main experiments),
and (ii) interactive tasks where LLM subagents produce
explicit solutions scored by a task-specific evaluator (Ap-
pendix B.5). ▶Payments. Unless otherwise noted, all main
experiments use a flat-fee contract, ri,t = P
J: µt(J)=i pi,J,t,
i.e., performance affects future opportunities via reputation
but not immediate payment. A performance-based variant
