year) to the next over a specified time horizon. At the start of the simulation,
• Households start with $0 savings, with i.i.d skills sampled at the beginning of every
training episode as ωij ∼N(1.0, 0.3).
• Firms start with 0 units of inventory and $0 deposits, with production elasticity
i.i.d sampled at the beginning of every training episode as αj ∼U[0.05, 1.0]. Also,
